title: Vincent
---
<<background Outside>>
<<play_sound "SetMusicToDramaTheme">>
<<hide agent>>
<<hide y/nbox>>
<<play_sound "PlaySFXHelicopter">>
Narrator: Wait a helicopter landed over there
Narrator: FBI is already here, who could it be?
<<play_sound "PlaySFXHelicopter">>
<<show y/nbox>>
<<show agent>>
FBI Agent: ?
FBI Agent: Who's there? get off the helicopter right now
<<hide agent>>
<<play_sound "PlaySFXFootsteps">>
<<show vincent_shadow>>
???: Well, well, well, what an absolutely delightful little tragedy we have unfolding on the pavement today~
???: Y/N, oh my sweet darling~ dry those pretty tears. There is nothing left to fear———for I have arrived~
<<hide y/nbox>>
Narrator: Eugene??? 
Narrator: bruh Eugene doesnt talk like that..?
<<show y/nbox>>
<<play_sound "PlaySFXWomanCry">>
y/n: You might wear his face, and you might wear his expensive suits, but you will never have his soul...
y/n: ...if you think for one single second that I will ever submit to you, you are completely out of your mind...
<<hide vincent_shadow>>
<<show vincent>>
y/n: ...VINCENT Felixius T. Ralph D. Richard Gallinaceus...!!!
<<play_sound "PlaySFXCrowdGasp">>
    -> THERES TWO OF THEM???
    -> HOLY SHT they are TWINS 
Vincent: It seems my twin brother always did have a spectacular talent for making a pathetic mess out of everything he touched~
Vincent: Grandmother has heard and spoken: Eugene Arthur K. Windsar A. Percival Gallinaceus is a disgrace to the entire Gallinaceus family~
Vincent: She has given me the rights to take full control of his estates, his bank accounts, and his properties from now on~
Vincent: Including you, Y/N... my little Aphrodite~
Vincent: And as for that mangy mutt shivering in your arms, feel free to just hand him over to the pound where a filthy beast like him truly belongs~
Vincent: ...and YOU, great work indeed~ 
<<hide y/n_sob>>
<<show secretary_anxious>>
Vincent: As promised, I will promote you to main manager of Gallinaceus enterprise~  
    -> HE'S YOUR GUY???
    -> bro eugene is so cooked
<<play_sound "PlaySFXVineboom">>
Secretary: ...THANK YOU, sir Vincent... I mean, my boss...!
Vincent: It breaks my heart to see a TALENT like you be WASTED in managing my brother's daily chores~ 
Vincent: Don't let me down~ 
Secretary: I WON'T...! I shall dedicate my ENTIRE life to you, boss!
<<hide secretary_anxious>>
Vincent: Oh~ lastly, I must be missing someone here~ someone, SPECIAL.
Vincent: ...YOU. My most trusted SECURITY GUARD. You did a SPLENDID job~
    -> me?
Vincent: Ah, my good man! I simply must express my absolute, deepest gratitude for your spectacular service today~
Vincent: Who do you think protected your employment in the Gallinaceus Villa~?
Vincent: Who do you think paved your way to uncovering the SECRETS~? 
Vincent: How adorable~ You really thought you could've done it all on your own~?
    -> narrator ur on his side too
<<hide y/nbox>>
Narrator: Bro LEAVE ME OUTTA THIS
Narrator: im ur guy trust 
<<show y/nbox>>
